  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PLGSP-Financial Aid to support transition to federalism and elected local bodies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Assistance to Government of Nepal, through the Ministry of Federal Affairs and General Administration (MoFAGA), to implement PLGSP to assist in strengthening administrative mechanisms; improve better delivery of quality services; strengthen Inter-Governmental Coordination and Cooperation; and capacity building of civil servants and elected representatives. The Financial Assistance includes support to the Technical Assistance Service Provider (TASP) UNDP for the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
